OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do people in the South want
OL,4,Afrom the Budget?
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is preparing to
OL,7,Fdeliver his first budget on Wednesday.
OL,9,FFor small businesses hit by soaring
OL,10,Ffuel prices, and first-time buyers
OL,11,Fstruggling to get on the housing
OL,12,Fladder, there is a lot riding on it.
OL,14,FThe BBC has been speaking to people
OL,15,Facross the South about what they want
OL,16,Fto see.
OL,18,FThe Treasury said the chancellor was
OL,19,Falready "giving the high street more
OL,20,Fbreathing space", including by cutting
OL,21,Fbusiness rates.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
